chmelze","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"c1-33-goethe-mini-5","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, ich gehe meinen Vortrag noch einmal durch — fehlt dir noch etwas Wichtiges?","speaker":"Doreen","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_033_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-33-goethe-mini-5","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ich verpflichte mich, den Teil über die Methodik zu übernehmen, wenn du dich um die Ergebnisse kümmerst.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_033_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-33-goethe-mini-5","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Abgemacht, dann sind wir für die Konferenz morgen bestens vorbereitet.","speaker":"Doreen","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_033_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-33-goethe-mini-5","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Genau, jetzt fehlt nur noch der letzte Blick auf die Folien.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_033_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-33-goethe-mini-5","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-33-goethe-mini-5","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, ich gehe meinen Vortrag noch einmal durch — fehlt dir noch etwas Wichtiges?","speaker":"Doreen","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_033_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-33-goethe-mini-5","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ich verpflichte mich, den Teil über die Methodik zu übernehmen, wenn du dich um die Ergebnisse kümmerst.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_033_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-33-goethe-mini-5","level":"C1","section":"listening","type"